where $\mathbf{j} = \begin{pmatrix} 0 \\ 1 \\ 0 \\ 0 \end{pmatrix}$.
We have $\mathbf{v} \cdot \mathbf{j} = a(0) + b(1) + c(0) + d(0) = b$.
Also, $\|\mathbf{j}\|^2 = 0^2 + 1^2 + 0^2 + 0^2 = 1$.
Therefore,
$$ \text{proj}_{\mathbf{j}} \mathbf{v} = \frac{b}{1} \mathbf{j} = b \mathbf{j} = \begin{pmatrix} 0 \\ b \\ 0 \\ 0 \end{pmatrix}. $$
